Package: ridgegraph
Type: Package
Title: Effective Penalty, Leakage and Edge Selection for Ridge
        Precision Matrices
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Mohammad", "Arashi", email = "arashi@um.ac.ir",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for extracting networks from the ridge estimator of a
    precision matrix, (S + lambda I)^{-1}. The package computes ridge partial
    correlations, the estimated effective penalty of the ridge estimator and
    its lower limit, a two-point extrapolation across penalties that removes
    the part of the ridge bias that is linear in the penalty, and a
    multi-penalty permutation threshold that controls the probability of any
    false edge under complete independence.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: stats
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: no
Author: Mohammad Arashi [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Mohammad Arashi <arashi@um.ac.ir>
